{
  "episode_id": "2026-08-13",
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "听众朋友大家好，欢迎收听AI 每日先锋，今天是2026年8月13日。我是苏晴。",
      "start": 1.0,
      "duration": 6.705,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_001_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_001_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "大家好，我是周航。",
      "start": 8.154,
      "duration": 1.611,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_002_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_002_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "周航，你今天看新闻了吗？ 微软那边整了个挺有意思的东西出来，叫 MindTopo。",
      "start": 10.262,
      "duration": 6.661,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_003_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_003_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "看了看了，专门给视觉语言模型做\"智商检测\"的。 你注意啊，这名字起得挺形象——Mind 加 Topo，脑子里的拓扑学。",
      "start": 17.376,
      "duration": 9.056,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_004_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_004_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "拓扑学？ 这不就是几何里那些橡皮筋嘛，能拉能扯形状变了但核心关系不变的那个？",
      "start": 26.837,
      "duration": 7.924,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_005_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_005_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，这次他们测的就是这种能力。比如给模型看一张图，问它\"这几根绳子打没打结\"、\"这个围栏围没围死\"、\"这条路径能不能走通\"。",
      "start": 35.194,
      "duration": 9.839,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_006_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_006_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我跟你说，结果肯定很打脸吧？",
      "start": 45.498,
      "duration": 2.351,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_007_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_007_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "何止打脸，简直是大型翻车现场。研究发现，目前主流的视觉语言模型在图片描述上已经很溜了，但一旦涉及这种需要空间推理的任务，准确率就哗哗往下掉。",
      "start": 48.311,
      "duration": 13.864,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_008_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_008_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "所以这说明什么？说明这些模型其实只是在\"认图\"，不是真正\"理解\"图。",
      "start": 62.626,
      "duration": 6.487,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_009_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_009_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你总结得挺到位的。问题是，它们能把一只猫描述得栩栩如生，但你让它判断迷宫里能不能走出去，它就懵了。 这种能力其实是人类三岁小孩都有的常识。",
      "start": 69.613,
      "duration": 12.19,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_010_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_010_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这也太扎心了吧，那通向 AGI 的路是不是又远了一截？",
      "start": 82.241,
      "duration": 5.007,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_011_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_011_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "说白了，这事儿提醒行业一件事——别光在参数规模上卷了，基础认知能力不过关，堆再多数据也是空中楼阁。微软这个基准一出来，估计各家都得回去补课。",
      "start": 87.709,
      "duration": 13.453,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_012_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_012_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "好，话说第二件事儿也挺有意思的，Anthropic 的 Dario Amodei 你知道吧？他最近又被投资人\"投诉\"了。",
      "start": 101.607,
      "duration": 8.272,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_013_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_013_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这事儿我看了。说实话，Dario 这两年简直像个\"AI 末日预言家\"，到处讲 AI 可能带来灭绝级风险。",
      "start": 110.353,
      "duration": 8.272,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_014_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_014_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对啊，按理说关注 AI 安全不是好事儿吗？怎么投资人还不乐意了？",
      "start": 119.052,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_015_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_015_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，出发点是好的，但问题是——太频繁了，而且越来越像一种营销策略。每次发布会、每次采访都要念叨一遍\"AI 可能毁灭人类\"，投资人听多了就开始疲劳了。",
      "start": 125.916,
      "duration": 14.953,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_016_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_016_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我能理解，换我我也烦。你天天跟我说\"世界末日要来了\"，我第一年信，第二年将信将疑，第三年我得问你是不是在炒作了。",
      "start": 141.286,
      "duration": 11.842,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_017_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_017_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "而且你注意到没，Anthropic 本身就是靠\"安全 AI\"这个定位杀出来的，跟 OpenAI 形成差异化。但当这种叙事变成标配，反而会消耗市场信任。",
      "start": 153.564,
      "duration": 12.384,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_018_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_018_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这就跟狼来了的故事一样嘛。喊多了大家就麻木了，等真出事儿反而没人信。",
      "start": 166.365,
      "duration": 6.966,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_019_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_019_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "更尴尬的是，Dario 这种级别的 CEO 公开强调风险，监管层会怎么看？媒体会怎么解读？员工会怎么想？这些连锁反应他可能没完全算清楚。",
      "start": 173.827,
      "duration": 10.449,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_020_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_020_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "所以这就是把双刃剑——讲安全塑造品牌护城河，但讲多了就成了噪音。",
      "start": 184.688,
      "duration": 7.967,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_021_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_021_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，头部 AI 公司的掌舵者其实挺难的，技术叙事和商业现实之间本来就是矛盾的。",
      "start": 193.134,
      "duration": 6.966,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_022_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_022_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "行，那咱们聊点轻松的。对了，DeepMind 最近做了个特别有温度的东西，叫 SL2T，你知道吗？",
      "start": 200.532,
      "duration": 9.883,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_023_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_023_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "知道啊，手语转文本模型。说白了就是让 AI 看懂手语，然后实时翻译成文字。",
      "start": 210.883,
      "duration": 6.531,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_024_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_024_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这个太有意义了！你想啊，聋哑朋友以前要跟健听人沟通，要么找手语翻译，要么比划半天。有了这个技术，掏出手机就能交流。",
      "start": 217.904,
      "duration": 10.275,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_025_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_025_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "而且 DeepMind 这次用的是端到端的大模型架构，不是传统那种靠规则拼接的方式，理解语境的能力强很多。",
      "start": 228.656,
      "duration": 8.403,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_026_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_026_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这才是 AI 该有的样子嘛——不是炫技，是真的帮人解决生活中的难题。",
      "start": 237.477,
      "duration": 5.965,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_027_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_027_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，这个方向我特别看好。无障碍 AI 可能是大模型最容易落地的场景之一。",
      "start": 243.881,
      "duration": 5.834,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_028_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_028_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "还有个事儿也挺好玩，Google Search 出了个新功能，你能猜到是啥吗？",
      "start": 250.127,
      "duration": 6.313,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_029_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_029_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你别说了，是不是又整了什么 AI 生成内容塞进搜索结果？",
      "start": 256.933,
      "duration": 5.703,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_030_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_030_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哈哈猜错了一半。这次是专门做\"晚宴策划\"的。你直接跟搜索框说\"我想请朋友吃顿晚餐，要有点氛围\"，它就能帮你搞定菜单、氛围布置，甚至帮你想好客人配对。",
      "start": 263.045,
      "duration": 16.389,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_031_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_031_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "客人配对？这也太贴心了吧。",
      "start": 279.921,
      "duration": 2.569,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_032_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_032_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对啊，它会根据你朋友们的背景、职业、兴趣给你建议谁跟谁坐一起聊天不容易冷场。",
      "start": 282.932,
      "duration": 7.837,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_033_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_033_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "说白了，搜索框正式变成\"生活管家\"了。以前大家说\"百度一下，你就知道\"，现在得改成\"Google 一下，晚饭都有了\"。",
      "start": 291.229,
      "duration": 8.62,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_034_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_034_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我跟你说，这功能我要是用上了，估计每周都得请人吃饭。",
      "start": 300.32,
      "duration": 4.18,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_035_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_035_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "那你钱包先受不了。",
      "start": 304.912,
      "duration": 2.395,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_036_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_036_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哈哈。最后说个轻松的——黄仁勋今年又登顶 Glassdoor 年度最佳 CEO 了。",
      "start": 307.752,
      "duration": 7.793,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_037_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_037_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这有啥意外的？NVIDIA 这两年在 AI 浪潮里赚麻了，老黄作为掌舵人，员工跟着吃肉，满意度能不高吗？",
      "start": 316.0,
      "duration": 7.88,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_038_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_038_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我跟你说，老黄这个人也是真性情。别的 CEO 出席活动西装革履的，他永远一身皮衣，跟逛自家后院似的。",
      "start": 324.32,
      "duration": 9.404,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_039_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_039_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这种个人魅力其实也是加分项。员工会觉得老板有血有肉，不是那种高高在上的精英感。",
      "start": 334.202,
      "duration": 6.139,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_040_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_040_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "而且 NVIDIA 的股票这几年的表现就不用我多说了吧？ 股价涨成这样，期权价值翻倍，谁不想去？",
      "start": 340.822,
      "duration": 10.231,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_041_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_041_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "没错。 说白了，CEO 好不好，员工最直观的感受就是——公司赚不赚钱、股价涨不涨、奖金发不发。 从这几点看，老黄确实是\"梦中情老板\"。",
      "start": 351.479,
      "duration": 12.645,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_042_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_042_lively.mp3"
